1. Teachers
   └── HEAD_TEACHER can list teachers

2. Students
   └── HEAD_TEACHER can manage
   └── TEACHER sees assigned students

3. Classes
   └── HEAD_TEACHER manages
   └── TEACHER sees assigned classes

4. Teaching Assignments
   └── HEAD_TEACHER manages
   └── TEACHER sees own

5. Exams
   └── HEAD_TEACHER manages
   └── TEACHER manages assigned

6. Exam Results
   └── TEACHER manages assigned
   └── STUDENT sees own
   └── GUARDIAN sees child's

7. Attendance
   └── same relationship model

8. Events
   └── school-level permissions

A. For ClassController, use:

   Create class: SUPER_ADMIN, HEAD_TEACHER
   View classes: all authenticated school members
   View one class: all authenticated school members
   Update class: SUPER_ADMIN, HEAD_TEACHER
   Delete class: SUPER_ADMIN, HEAD_TEACHER

